{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p></p>\n<p>Chiikawa銀包又要失守啦！全新診所主題精品將於11月27日起，登陸日本全國多地專門店及快閃店。今次一眾角色換上超可愛的護士服與白衣，化身醫護為大家「看診」！\n</p>\n<p>首波周邊細節滿分，除了必搶的「祝你早日康復」護士帽及聽診器公仔，更推出醫院元素實用小物。例如可裝入公仔的X光片痛包、藥袋造型袋仔及視力檢查帆布袋，連病毒化Ode都有專屬迷你套裝。</p>\n<p>發售點涵蓋原宿、心齋橋等官方專門店Chiikawa Land，而東京站、名古屋及梅田等亦設快閃店。實體店買滿8,800日圓更隨機送公仔頭像襟章！</p>\n<p>📅日期：2026年11月27日起<br/>\n📍地點：Chiikawa Land專門店、官方網店及多地快閃店（如東京站、名古屋PARCO、梅田KIDDY LAND等）<br/>\n🩵款式太多不能盡錄，留言「Chiikawa」我send條link比你慢慢睇有咩款～\n</p>\n<p>購物提案 ｜ 為你搜羅各地購物好去處，分享各種消費攻略，等你買得有眼光！即刻DM我哋分享你嘅購物提案！</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.gotrip.hk/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179449207345799406_10680707036af5c6ab3974a.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.gotrip.hk/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179449207345799406_10680707036af5c6ab3974a.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.gotrip.hk/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179449207817299899_13836976636af5c6af1c846.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.gotrip.hk/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179449207817299899_13836976636af5c6af1c846.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.gotrip.hk/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17944920805036788_14204642086af5c6b17d972.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.gotrip.hk/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17944920805036788_14204642086af5c6b17d972.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.gotrip.hk/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179449208357866965_10083078046af5c6b60bfad.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.gotrip.hk/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179449208357866965_10083078046af5c6b60bfad.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.gotrip.hk/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179449208841313565_4300237016af5c6baca4d8.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.gotrip.hk/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179449208841313565_4300237016af5c6baca4d8.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.gotrip.hk/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17944920938602362_6706018646af5c6bf83335.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.gotrip.hk/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17944920938602362_6706018646af5c6bf83335.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.gotrip.hk/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179449209766812241_1674319016af5c6c3067a9.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.gotrip.hk/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179449209766812241_1674319016af5c6c3067a9.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.gotrip.hk/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179449210174371206_5655924476af5c6c647bc4.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.gotrip.hk/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179449210174371206_5655924476af5c6c647bc4.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.gotrip.hk/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179449210344829085_1699018006af5c6c816ea8.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=